<div class="static-page">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 800px;">
    <div class="page-hero">
      <h1><i class="bi bi-building me-2"></i>About Us</h1>
      <p class="lead">Bringing the best of Kenya to your doorstep</p>
    </div>

    <div class="page-content">
      <div class="content-card">
        <h3>Our Story</h3>
        <p>Founded in Nairobi, Kenya, our E-Commerce Store was born from a passion for connecting Kenyan artisans, farmers, and manufacturers with customers who appreciate quality and authenticity. We believe that every product tells a story — from the handwoven sisal baskets of Machakos to the premium AA coffee from the highlands.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="content-card">
        <h3>Our Mission</h3>
        <p>To empower local businesses by providing a platform that showcases authentic Kenyan products to a global audience. We're committed to fair trade practices, quality assurance, and exceptional customer service.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="values-grid">
        <div class="value-card">
          <div class="value-icon"><i class="bi bi-heart-fill"></i></div>
          <h5>Quality First</h5>
          <p>Every product is vetted for quality before listing</p>
        </div>
        <div class="value-card">
          <div class="value-icon"><i class="bi bi-people-fill"></i></div>
          <h5>Community</h5>
          <p>Supporting local artisans and small businesses</p>
        </div>
        <div class="value-card">
          <div class="value-icon"><i class="bi bi-shield-fill-check"></i></div>
          <h5>Trust</h5>
          <p>Secure payments and buyer protection</p>
        </div>
        <div class="value-card">
          <div class="value-icon"><i class="bi bi-truck"></i></div>
          <h5>Fast Delivery</h5>
          <p>Reliable shipping across Kenya</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="content-card">
        <h3>Get in Touch</h3>
        <p>Have questions? We'd love to hear from you. <%= link_to "Contact our team", new_contact_message_path, style: "color: #667eea; font-weight: 600;" %> and we'll get back to you within 24 hours.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<%= render "pages/shared_styles" %>
